hday present for my nephew. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le07ob10aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "These are words you use when you talk about hobbies and interests."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to be due"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "used to say something must be submitted at a certain time "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: My assignment is due in a week."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le07ob10aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to be into"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "used to say someone is very interested in something "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: My brother's really into computers and music."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le07ob10aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "movie script"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "the written form of a film"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: He likes watching films and reading movie scripts."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le07ob10aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "movie poster "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a large paper advertisement for a film"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: If you know his favorite film, you could get him a movie poster."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le07ob10aud05"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "interest "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "something you like, you are interested in "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: What are his hobbies or interests?"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engen